    <!-- Guide -->
    <string name="section_guide">Field workflow</string>
    <string name="guide_text">1. Turn on the phone hotspot (2.4 GHz, WPA2), then EmotiBit.\n2. Connect, start recording and wait for 2 time syncs.\n3. Tap the sync marker in front of the camera.\n4. Follow the participant. When you are out of range EmotiBit keeps recording; whenever you come close again the app reconnects and collects time syncs on its own.\n5. At the end, choose Safe stop. It stops after fresh time syncs, even if you press it before you are back in range.\n6. Copy the files from the SD card and parse them with EmotiBit DataParser.</string>

